```

TEXT ENGINE CAPABILITIES

READ Operations:

├── ParseDocument(file) → TextGraph

├── ExtractSection(graph, section_id) → SectionGraph

├── FindParagraphs(graph, query) → [ParagraphNode]

├── GetSentences(paragraph) → [SentenceNode]

├── GetGrammar(sentence) → GrammarGraph

└── TraverseCoreferences(entity) → [EntityMention]

WRITE Operations:

├── CreateDocument(title, type) → DocumentNode

├── InsertSection(document, after_section, content) → SectionNode

├── InsertParagraph(section, position, content) → ParagraphNode

├── ModifySentence(sentence_id, new_content) → SentenceNode

├── DeleteNode(node_id) → UpdatedGraph

└── ReorderParagraphs(section, new_order) → UpdatedGraph

SYNTHESIS Operations:

├── GenerateParagraph(topic, style, length) → ParagraphNode

├── SummarizeSection(section) → SummaryNode

├── ExpandOutline(outline) → FullDocument

├── AdaptStyle(content, from_style, to_style) → StyledContent

└── TranslateContent(content, target_language) → TranslatedContent

```

