│                    BIDIRECTIONAL SYNC                                        │

├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤

│                                                                             │

│  FILE → GRAPH SYNC (on file change)                                         │

│  ────────────────────────────────────                                       │

│                                                                             │

│  1. Detect file change (watcher or version control)                        │

│  2. DiffDetection: compare current file to cached version                  │

│  3. For each changed region:                                                │

│     a. FindAffectedNodes(position) → [SentenceNode, ParagraphNode]         │

│     b. ReParse changed content                                              │

│     c. UpdateGrammarNodes(changed sentences)                               │

│     d. PropagateCoreferenceChanges()                                        │

│     e. RevalidateDocumentStructure()                                        │

│  4. Store new version in graph cache                                        │

│                                                                             │

├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤

│                                                                             │

│  GRAPH → FILE SYNC (on AGI edit)                                            │

│  ─────────────────────────────────                                           │

│                                                                             │

│  1. AGI modifies graph (e.g., SentenceNode.content changed)                │

│  2. CalculatePositionDiff(old_content, new_content)                        │

