## Processing Details

### Per-Chunk Processing (Phase 1)

```

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐

│                    PER-CHUNK PROCESSING                                      │

├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤

│                                                                             │

│  INPUT: RawChunk { index, text, start_char, end_char }                     │

│  OUTPUT: ChunkGraph { paragraph_nodes, sentence_nodes, section_events }    │

│                                                                             │

│  STEPS:                                                                     │

│                                                                             │

│  1. CLEAN CHUNK                                                             │

│     - Grammar correction                                                    │

│     - Normalization (consistent quotes, dashes, etc.)                      │

│     - Preserve structure (paragraph breaks, sentence boundaries)           │

│                                                                             │

│  2. DETECT PARAGRAPHS                                                       │

│     - Split on \n\n or double line breaks                                  │

│     - Track paragraph starts/ends                                          │

│     - Calculate byte offsets                                               │

│                                                                             │

│  3. DETECT SENTENCES (within each paragraph)                               │

│     - Split on sentence boundaries (. ! ?)                                 │

│     - Handle abbreviations, decimals, URLs                                 │

│     - Calculate byte offsets                                               │

│                                                                             │

│  4. SECTION STATE TRACKING                                                  │

│     - Check for headers (markdown, numbered, all-caps)                     │

│     - Maintain state from previous chunk                                   │

│     - Detect section starts/ends/document breaks                           │

│                                                                             │

│  5. CREATE NODES                                                            │

│     - ParagraphNode for each paragraph                                     │

│     - SentenceNode for each sentence                                       │

│     - SectionNode if section start detected                                │

│     - DocumentNode if document boundary detected                           │

│                                                                             │

│  6. STORE POSITIONS                                                         │

│     - byte_range for each node                                             │

│     - chunk_id, chunk_offset for reconstruction                            │

│                                                                             │

│  STATE CARRIED TO NEXT CHUNK:                                               │

│    - current_section_id                                                    │

│    - current_section_level                                                 │

│    - formatting_pattern                                                    │

│    - current_document_id                                                   │

│                                                                             │

└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

```

